      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    fund_value = 100_000_000\n    current_equity_allocation = 0.80\n    target_equity_allocation = 0.60\n    equity_beta = 1.2\n    futures_beta = 0.95\n    index_value = 1_200\n    contract_multiplier = 250\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    reduction_in_equity = fund_value * (current_equity_allocation - target_equity_allocation)\n    contract_value = index_value * contract_multiplier\n    contracts_to_sell = reduction_in_equity * equity_beta / (contract_value * futures_beta)\n    answer = round(contracts_to_sell, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
